sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Media as IMeetingMediaService
    participant JitsiAdapter as Infrastructure: JitsiMeetingMediaService
    participant App as Application: Meetings + AiSummary handlers
    participant Db as IApplicationDbContext
    participant Storage as Object Storage Adapter
    participant Queue as Background Job Queue
    participant Speech as ITranscriptionService
    participant Summary as IAiSummaryService
    participant Hub as SignalR NotificationHub
    actor Manager as Manager / Organizer
    participant Flutter as Flutter Client

    Note over Media,JitsiAdapter: Jitsi returns a provider recording reference only through Infrastructure.
    Media->>JitsiAdapter: StopRecordingAsync(StopRecordingRequest)
    JitsiAdapter-->>Media: RecordingResult(mediaRecordingReference)
    Media-->>App: Provider-neutral recording result
    App->>Db: Create MeetingRecording(status=Pending)
    App->>Queue: Enqueue ProcessMeetingRecording(recordingId)
    App-->>Hub: Publish recordingProcessing
    Hub-->>Flutter: recordingProcessing

    Queue->>App: ProcessMeetingRecording(recordingId)
    App->>Db: Load recording + authorize workflow state
    App->>Storage: Resolve / persist media object using opaque reference
    Storage-->>App: StorageObjectKey
    App->>Db: Update recording storage reference
    App->>Speech: TranscribeAsync(TranscriptionRequest)
    Note over Speech: Concrete Whisper/Azure Speech adapter is resolved in Infrastructure.
    Speech-->>App: TranscriptionAccepted(providerJobReference)
    App->>Db: Create TranscriptionJob(status=Processing)

    loop Until transcription terminal state
        App->>Speech: GetStatusAsync(providerJobReference)
        Speech-->>App: Processing or completed result
    end

    alt Transcription completed
        App->>Db: Save segments and mark job Completed
        App->>Summary: GenerateMeetingSummaryAsync(summary request)
        Note over Summary: Concrete summarization/task-extraction provider is resolved in Infrastructure.
        Summary-->>App: SummaryDraft(decisions, proposedActionItems)
        App->>Db: Save MeetingSummary(status=Draft)
        App-->>Hub: Publish summaryReadyForReview
        Hub-->>Flutter: summaryReadyForReview
        Manager->>Flutter: Review and approve summary
        Flutter->>App: ApproveMeetingSummaryCommand
        App->>Db: Mark summary Approved and persist confirmed tasks
        App-->>Hub: Publish actionItemsCreated
        Hub-->>Flutter: actionItemsCreated
    else Transcription failed
        App->>Db: Mark job Failed with ErrorCode
        App-->>Hub: Publish transcriptionFailed
        Hub-->>Flutter: transcriptionFailed
    end

    Note over App,Flutter: AI output is reviewable and tasks become operational only after summary approval.
